# Only needed for the S3 variant (USB shell and DFU, see sysbuild.conf and
# boards/xiao_esp32s3_procpu.overlay): the chip currently runs an app that
# owns the USB OTG port for CDC-ACM, so esptool can no longer reset it into
# the ROM bootloader over that port; this test is deployed with `west dfu`
# like every other S3 app in this repo instead. The C6 variant does not
# build sysbuild and never uses this.

